 [ OVERVIEW ]
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Title        : DIB_Sync
 Author       : m0xX
 Platform     : Windows (Win7 through Win11, 32-bit / 64-bit compatible)
 Type         : Native Win32 Audio-Visual Demo / Demoscene Engine
 Binary Size  : ~80 KB (Compressed via Petite v2.2)
 Audio Engine : MiniFMOD (Embedded XM Tracker Module, 48 KB)
 Rendering    : Direct-RAM ARGB DIB Section + Inline x86 Assembly (RDTSC PRNG)


 [ FEATURES & SLOTS ]
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * 21 Real-time visual slots with seamless transition framework
 * Slot 20: Procedural B&W TV Static, VCR horizontal tearing & V-SYNC roll
 * Audio-reactive beat sync modulation driven by g_beatPulse
 * Zero hardware GPU requirements — 100% CPU software rasterization
 * Full screen / Windowed resolution selector with customizable frame cap


 [ RUNTIME CONTROLS ]
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 [ ENTER ]      : Confirm startup resolution & launch
 [ SPACE ]      : Jump immediately to next visual slot
 [ ESC ]        : Exit application


 [ TECH STACK & CREDITS ]
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Code & FX      : m0xX (Compiled with IWBasic 2.5)
 Audio Library  : MiniFMOD by Firelight Technologies
 Executable Pack: Petite v2.2 by un4seen developments
 Target OS      : Optimized for low-latency Win32 DIB surface rendering


 [ REQUIREMENTS & COMPATIBILITY ]
 -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Works out of the box on Windows 7, 10, and 11. No external DLL dependencies,
 no runtime installers required. Fully standalone binary.

